<!--
  The themed-icon variant, for launchers that tint the icon to match the wallpaper.

  Same shapes as ic_launcher_foreground.xml, but a single flat colour: the launcher
  supplies the tint, and anything drawn in a fixed colour here would either be
  ignored or fight with it. The arrow is a hole rather than a black shape, because
  on a themed icon there is no background to be the same colour as.
-->
